      <p source="#source-241-273"><seg source="#source-241-273">愁ひ来て丘にのぼりて</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-273-314"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-273-285"><rb>酸</rb><rt>す</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-285-314">の香る蜜柑もぐなり</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-314-345"><seg source="#source-314-345">悲しみの青き蜜柑を</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-345-374"><seg source="#source-345-374">栗林こえて見ゆるは</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-374-406"><seg source="#source-374-406">背きにし君の町なるぞ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-406-440"><seg source="#source-406-440">ゆふぐれに深く沈みて</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-440-481"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-440-452"><rb>掌</rb><rt>て</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-452-481">にしみる青き蜜柑よ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-481-513"><seg source="#source-481-513">そをかみて何を思はむ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-513-556"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-513-528"><rb>昔</rb><rt>かみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-528-556">の日は皆空しきに</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-556-588"><seg source="#source-556-588">ああされど君も寂しと</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-588-617"><seg source="#source-588-617">この丘の青き蜜柑の</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-617-654"><seg source="#source-617-654">その香りなぜか愛でたり</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-654-683"><seg source="#source-654-683">自らの影をふみつつ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-683-715"><seg source="#source-683-715">ゆふぐれの丘を下りき</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-715-742"><seg source="#source-715-742">掌に悲し青き蜜柑よ</seg></p>
    </body>
